<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on mark/Swiss franc.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on mark/Swiss franc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued four million call and put warrants, in four equal tranches, on the mark/Swiss franc rate, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE</p>
<p> CALL A	  0.83 CHF    4.91 CHF</p>
<p> PUT B	   0.83 CHF    1.21 CHF</p>
<p> CALL C	  0.87 CHF    1.72 CHF</p>
<p> PUT D	   0.87 CHF    3.17 CHF</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   16.MAR.98		 PAYDATE	06.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  0.8665 CHF</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
